{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Write-Output \"=== s01-envelope-reject.md ===\"; Get-Content docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/s01-envelope-reject.md -Raw; Write-Output \"=== s01-acceptance.json ===\"; Get-Content docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/s01-acceptance.json -Raw; Write-Output \"=== S01-SHA256SUMS ===\"; Get-Content docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/S01-SHA256SUMS -Raw; Write-Output \"=== SHA256SUMS (root) ===\"; Get-Content docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/SHA256SUMS -Raw'","aggregated_output":"=== s01-envelope-reject.md ===\r\n# S01：Provider 内容守卫的可拒绝窄边界\n\n日期：2026-10-13（Asia/Shanghai）。包码：S01（TF-0276）。真实 provider 调用：无。\n\n## 范围\n\n把已有的 Stage-1 请求信封守卫从 shadow-only 观察升级为一个 **opt-in 可拒绝边界**：只有 RC-02 shadow 边界活动、且显式开启开关、且信封 `!ok` 时，才在 `fetchWithSsrFGuard` 之前抛出 `ProviderEnvelopeRejectedError`，从而不发送任何 provider 字节。\n\n复用既有 RC-02 shadow 边界与既有 digest-only `shadow_wire` receipt；不新建 store/registry/router；不改变 SSRF、超时、代理、重定向或出站预算规则。\n\n## 开关\n\n- `ShadowReceiptOptions.rejectInvalidEnvelope`（默认 `false`），或\n- 环境变量 `OPENCLAW_RC02_REJECT_INVALID_ENVELOPE`。\n\n`resolveEnvelopeRejectEnabled()` 默认返回 false，所以默认与 flag-off 路径**与之前完全一致**（观察、不改变字节、请求照发）。\n\n## 顺序保证\n\n拒绝判定位于既有 `emitShadowWireReceipt(...)` 之后、`fetchWithSsrFGuard(...)` 之前：\n1. 先写 digest-only wire receipt（只含 digest/ref/相关性摘要）；\n2. 若开启且信封 `!ok` → throw，wire 从未发生。\n\n## 实测（本地，无真实 provider）\n\n- `resolveEnvelopeRejectEnabled`：默认 false；option/env 开启为 true；显式 false 为 false。\n- 开启 + 非法信封（`transformIds: ['definitely-unregistered-transform']`）：抛 `ProviderEnvelopeRejectedError`，**provider fetch 调用数 = 0**。\n- 关闭 + 同样非法信封：请求照常发出（fetch ≥ 1），行为不变。\n- 既有守卫单测 `shadow-census.test.ts` + `stage1-request-envelope.test.ts` 15/15 通过（无回归）。\n\n## 边界与基线残余\n\n- 网络 SSRF / 超时 / 代理 / 出站预算独立，本包不接管。\n- `openclaw_runtime` 的 **test-typecheck baseline 已红**：`tsgo:core:test` 在 7 个与本包无关的文件上共 12 条错误（context-health-monitor / http-endpoint-budget / tool-search-* / verseshell governed-process / capabilities v3 等），与 S01 文件无关，属既有基线，不扩大本包 ownedPaths 放行。\n- `rc02-shadow-census.acceptance.test.ts` 的 “embedded runner …” 用例在本机 30s 超时：**已用 revert-我的改动 的干净基线复现同样超时**，故为既有环境/性能残余，非 S01 引入。\n- 不改产品默认值/锁/approval；非真人证据。\n\r\n=== s01-acceptance.json ===\r\n{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\n  \"asOf\": \"2026-10-13\",\n  \"timezone\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\n  \"actor\": \"codex-s01-mainline-developer\",\n  \"driven_by\": \"agent\",\n  \"scope\": {\n    \"task\": \"TF-0276\",\n    \"packet\": \"S01\",\n    \"title\": \"Rejectable provider envelope boundary (opt-in, pre-wire)\",\n    \"source\": \"local mocked provider fetch (no live provider)\",\n    \"liveProvider\": false,\n    \"realHuman\": false\n  },\n  \"decision\": {\n    \"status\": \"PASS\",\n    \"evidenceTier\": \"clean-candidate-local-automated-acceptance\",\n    \"reason\": \"Opt-in reject path verified on the clean candidate: invalid envelope refused with 0 provider fetch calls and a typed error; flag-off path unchanged (request still sent); guard unit tests 15/15 pass. No product default/lock change; pre-existing baseline residuals recorded separately.\"\n  },\n  \"candidate\": {\n    \"commit\": \"f064ff2c592580763a564c5635f554130a8fa992\",\n    \"tree\": \"a9f4c53922f413afe5474e4529a34a86583579fc\",\n    \"dirty\": false,\n    \"branch\": \"codex/harness-gap-s01-envelope-reject-20261013\",\n    \"base\": \"ca24fb81ae83dde9907561b583b7990df6844b67\",\n    \"workspace\": \"C:\\\\Users\\\\27933\\\\.codex\\\\worktrees\\\\o02-main\\\\ClawX\",\n    \"startedAt\": \"2026-10-13T12:05:00.000Z\",\n    \"finishedAt\": \"2026-10-13T12:35:00.000Z\"\n  },\n  \"gates\": {\n    \"s01Tests\": {\n      \"command\": \"openclaw_runtime: node scripts/run-vitest.mjs run src/agents/rc02-envelope-reject.test.ts\",\n      \"exitCode\": 0,\n      \"files\": 1,\n      \"tests\": 3,\n      \"failed\": 0\n    },\n    \"guardRegression\": {\n      \"command\": \"openclaw_runtime: run-vitest src/agents