{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_454","type":"agent_message","text":"Everything is complete and verified. Final state:\n\n**Deliverables (6 files, all in `targetScope`)**\n- `docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/s02-sink-ledger.md` — per-sink enforcement ledger (narrow / source-dependent / classification-only) with policyFile/exportedSymbol/callSite/rejectsWith, the explicit \"不是全网强制\" claim, the six residual `network-send` exits, and a machine-readable JSON ledger block.\n- `tests/unit/sensitive-sink-residual-ledger.test.ts` — executable guard: forward-resolves every enforcement point against the working tree, pins the six residual exits as existing-and-ungated, reverse-scans `openclaw_runtime/src` so a newly wired provenance gate must be registered, parses the JSON ledger block, and asserts the not-global claim.\n- `harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-sink-ledger.md` — task spec (gateway-backend-communication, lifecycleStatus: active).\n- `harness/specs/rules/sensitive-sink-ledger-boundary.md` — rule spec.\n- `docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/s02-acceptance.json` — acceptance record.\n- `docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/S02-SHA256SUMS` — digests (5/5 readable).\n\n**Checks actually run (all exit 0 unless noted)**\n- `node node_modules/vitest/vitest.mjs run tests/unit/sensitive-sink-residual-ledger.test.ts` → 1 file, 6 passed\n- `... tests/unit/sensitive-sink-residual-ledger.test.ts tests/unit/external-content-provenance.test.ts` → 2 files, 14 passed\n- `... + tests/unit/harness-specs.test.ts` → 3 files, 57 passed\n- `tsgo --noEmit -p tsconfig.test.json --composite false` → 0\n- `eslint tests/unit/sensitive-sink-residual-ledger.test.ts` → 0\n- `node harness/src/cli.mjs validate --spec harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-sink-ledger.md` (both `--no-diff` and diff-aware in a throwaway git fixture) → \"Spec is valid\"; `run --dry-run` → pass\n- `node scripts/check-no-bom.mjs` → ok\n- `node scripts/scan-pattern.mjs` credential scan over the new files → 0 hits\n- `scripts/check-spec